{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:279e3bd8c80894b2c6d1d9f35a4e1fefe8e83fdedd2910a0425a9b6cdda0c37a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfdd6d35ff9545a41b23910c73980125741688b55ddac16b78d7ae1c954cd669",
      "text": "为了发自内心的笑容",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d36dc7d77e129e1fbcb90f607ac7a45935ec54f4e95510d8b47f161e54c80594",
      "text": "对了！这里，变得更闪亮一点，好不好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e9867ecbe8a38228bbe6cc7f3837c862784f49dd533c4c2a2726e5abd7ee19d",
      "text": "那个也很好呢！马上加进方案里吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb0b5595ea20689924fb39e7eddf3bc57e35481c133119bb4c7ac1e8315decd",
      "text": "……话说回来，要做出有纪念日感觉的演出还真挺难呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df660f68e141eb0955943fefca8a0d614f789713875039e1c9138dd09cf4685c",
      "text": "是啊。一下子能想到的点子都提完了，\n要是能换个视角看看就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a430d732b49568e0927b3b620e8cccbc6c4be3ce5b0c99740cd36cae3720c5e",
      "text": "我记得，Legenders也说过在构思演出\n效果吧。现在去跟他们商量看看怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f2140e644b84e158e8da14d922839898e26e031d73bb6c78db8aac8207526e2",
      "text": "我赞成！要说好多好多话！\n大家一起聊，会变得更棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b618530400d2011a6b6fa85679602ebf567ff6163d212607054fb0cb2b985a16",
      "text": "啊啊。正如皮埃尔所说。\n就算花时间，也要讨论到满意为止。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec33005cfb91b6c5fdfd27993c798bb54c4b5f481207e570ba1603827d3ef209",
      "text": "最重要的是，要打造出一个能让前来的客人们\n全都绽放笑容的舞台嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30ae72eaa2f7bb21490e1e4555011f707a9efed84bcfa23b87b1b4ba88388170",
      "text": "嗯！想让大家，都露出笑容！\n所以，要加倍努力哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_007_22_5_06_007_22:5_06_007_22:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1242ade2fa4bf44e84766c05074ba7e05e94c3c08d6f18cc34ec4b3a1b75de7b",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
